Dear Sir/Madam,

Greetings from Sardar Vallabhbhai National Institute of Technology, Surat.

The Department of Computer Science & Engineering is organising an
AICTE-ATAL sponsored Faculty Development Programme on "Cyber Forensics and
Email Threat Intelligence" from 22 to 26 September 2026 in hybrid mode.

We would be honoured if a member of the AICTE Cyber Security Cell could
deliver the inaugural keynote on 22 September at 10:30 AM. The tentative
schedule and the brochure are available on the institute website:
https://www.svnit.ac.in/fdp/cyberforensics2026

Kindly let us know a convenient time to discuss the logistics. There is no
registration fee for invited speakers; travel and accommodation will be
arranged by the institute as per AICTE norms.

Looking forward to your positive response.

Warm regards,
